    {
      "title": "Вход формой: db.open, токен — в cookie",
      "text": "Приложение подключается к дому один раз, при запуске: `connect(pass, { postman })` — это `db`, его пул служит всем жильцам. Обработчик формы входа зовёт `db.open({ email, password, ttl })` и кладёт токен сессии в cookie: `HttpOnly` — скрипты страницы его не прочтут, `SameSite=Lax` — его не пришлёт чужой сайт; на HTTPS добавьте `Secure`. Срок cookie — как у сессии (`ttl: '8h'`). Неверный пароль — `auth_failed`: обработчик отвечает 401 и не уточняет, что именно не так. Токен в выводе заменён меткой.",
      "code": "server = webApp(db);\nawait new Promise<void>((ready) => server.listen(0, '127.0.0.1', ready));\nsite = server.address() as AddressInfo;\nconst wrong = await browser(site, 'POST', '/login', { form: { email: annaKey.email, password: 'не тот' } });\nconst ok = await browser(site, 'POST', '/login', { form: annaKey });\ncookie = ok.setCookie!.split(';')[0]; // «sid=<токен>» — браузер присылает её с каждым запросом\nreturn {\n  'неверный пароль': { status: wrong.status, body: wrong.body },\n  'вход': { status: ok.status, body: ok.body },\n  'Set-Cookie': ok.setCookie!.replace(/sid=[0-9a-f]+/, 'sid=‹токен›'),\n};",
      "html": "<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">server </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> webApp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(db);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ready</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> server.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">listen</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'127.0.0.1'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, ready));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">site </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> server.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">address</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AddressInfo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> wrong</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> browser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(site, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'POST'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/login'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { form: { email: annaKey.email, password: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'не тот'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ok</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> browser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(site, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'POST'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/login'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { form: annaKey });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">cookie </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ok.setCookie</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">split</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">';'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// «sid=&#x3C;токен>» — браузер присылает её с каждым запросом</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'неверный пароль'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { status: wrong.status, body: wrong.body },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'вход'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { status: ok.status, body: ok.body },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'Set-Cookie'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: ok.setCookie</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">replace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">sid=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">[0-9a-f]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'sid=‹токен›'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre>",
